OL,3,AMan killed by falling tree as Storm
OL,4,ABoelo brings strong winds and heavy
OL,5,Arain to UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FVideo from Largs, in Ayrshire, shows
OL,8,Fwater flowing through the town centre;
OL,9,Fa phone shop in Dumbarton was flooded
OL,10,Fovernight; while a boat was washed onto
OL,11,Fthe street in Gourock
OL,13,FThere's disruption on the railways; a
OL,14,Fnumber of flights have been cancelled -
OL,15,Fincluding more than 20 from Leeds
OL,16,FBradford; while ferry services are also
OL,17,Fsuspended
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
