OL,3,ABurnham open to 'honest discussion' on
OL,4,AEU free movement
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked about Burnham's remarks, Angela
OL,7,FRayner told the BBC's Sunday with Laura
OL,8,FKuenssberg "you can't take anything off
OL,9,Fthe table", adding the prime minister
OL,10,Fwas saying "we've got to be pragmatic
OL,11,Fto get the best deal for Britain and he
OL,12,Fwants to have the conversation."
OL,14,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,15,Fresponded that the prime minister
OL,16,F"hasn't thought this through", while
OL,17,FReform UK's Robert Jenrick dismissed
OL,18,Fthe idea as "mad".
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
