OL,3,ACouple were celebrating anniversary
OL,4,Abefore Bahamas tragedy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe husband of a woman who died as she
OL,7,Ftried to rescue her two sons when they
OL,8,Fwere swept out to sea in the Bahamas
OL,9,Fsaid they had been celebrating their
OL,10,F10th wedding anniversary.
OL,12,FLeanne Gregory, from Stapleford in
OL,13,FNottinghamshire, had been on a family
OL,14,Fholiday with husband Nathan when he
OL,15,Fbelieves their boys were swept into the
OL,16,Focean by a riptide.
OL,18,FAlthough the children were rescued from
OL,19,Fthe water on Tuesday, their mother was
OL,20,Funable to be saved, the Royal Bahamas
OL,21,FPolice Force said.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
