OL,3,AVenezuelan opposition leader Maria
OL,4,AMachado returns after months in exile
OL,5,
OL,6,FVenezuelan opposition leader Maria
OL,7,FCorina Machado has returned home to a
OL,8,Ffraught political landscape after over
OL,9,F10 months in exile.
OL,11,F"I am here. With you," Machado wrote on
OL,12,FX on Sunday.
OL,14,FHer ally, former presidential candidate
OL,15,FEdmundo Gonzalez, confirmed the news
OL,16,Fminutes later, writing: "I am thrilled
OL,17,Fto announce to you that our leader, my
OL,18,Fdear Maria Corina, is on Venezuelan
OL,19,Fsoil."
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
