OL,3,AEarly reports suggest record high
OL,4,Aturnout in Serbia elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarly reports suggest Serbian voters
OL,7,Fhave turned out in large numbers for
OL,8,Fits parliamentary election, as a
OL,9,Fstudent protest movement attempts to
OL,10,Fend the rule of the country's
OL,11,Fright-wing populist leader.
OL,13,FPreliminary reports suggest a record
OL,14,Fhigh turnout, with 46% having cast
OL,15,Ftheir vote by 14:00 local time (13:00
OL,16,FGMT), nearly a million more than the
OL,17,Fcomparable figure for the previous
OL,18,Felection in December 2023.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
